{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\IntegrationSignd\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "phpunit/phpunit is in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Listener/LoadAdditionalListener.php:31 OCP\\IConfig::getAppValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 29; Use IAppConfig directly",
        "lib/Service/SignApiService.php:30 OCP\\IConfig::getAppValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 29; Use IAppConfig directly",
        "lib/Service/SignApiService.php:46 OCP\\IConfig::getAppValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 29; Use IAppConfig directly",
        "lib/Service/SignApiService.php:50 OCP\\IConfig::setAppValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 29; Use IAppConfig directly"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "4 uses in 2 files of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 33 to 34. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Listener/LoadAdditionalListener.php:31 OCP\\IConfig::getAppValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 29; Use IAppConfig directly",
        "  lib/Service/SignApiService.php:30 OCP\\IConfig::getAppValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 29; Use IAppConfig directly",
        "  lib/Service/SignApiService.php:46 OCP\\IConfig::getAppValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 29; Use IAppConfig directly",
        "  lib/Service/SignApiService.php:50 OCP\\IConfig::setAppValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 29; Use IAppConfig directly"
      ],
      "folds": [
        {
          "at": 4,
          "count": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "config-without-lexicon",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Listener/LoadAdditionalListener.php:31 getAppValue()",
        "lib/Service/SignApiService.php:30 getAppValue()",
        "lib/Service/SignApiService.php:46 getAppValue()",
        "lib/Service/SignApiService.php:50 setAppValue()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "The app reads and writes its app config in 4 places and registers no config lexicon, which IRegistrationContext::registerConfigLexicon() takes since Nextcloud 31. A lexicon states the type, the default and the sensitivity of each key in one place.",
        "  lib/Listener/LoadAdditionalListener.php:31 getAppValue()",
        "  lib/Service/SignApiService.php:30 getAppValue()",
        "  lib/Service/SignApiService.php:46 getAppValue()",
        "  lib/Service/SignApiService.php:50 setAppValue()"
      ],
      "folds": [
        {
          "at": 4,
          "count": 1
        }
      ]
    }
